{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the CEO and founder of Selene Dynamics, a space exploration corporation. You have just launched your flagship mission to colonize the moon and mine its lucrative resources. Type2 is a space based city builder where you try to run a mining business on the moon. Through buying, placing, and maintaining various facilities on the lunar surface, you can use your management skills to sustain a colony, expand your company, and of course, make money! As you progress, you will be able to unlock more and better buildings to further your enterprise. This is a demo, as Type2 is still in development so all features may not be fully complete. You can expect to experience the game in roughly 20 minutes. Have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4083220?t=1760633783","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4083220?t=1760633783","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083220/b23cd21fe1a81dce5ec57090d63d872d7fd7003a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760633783","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083220/b23cd21fe1a81dce5ec57090d63d872d7fd7003a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760633783","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the CEO and founder of Selene Dynamics, a space exploration corporation. You have just launched your flagship mission to colonize the moon and mine its lucrative resources. Type2 is a space based city builder where you try to run a mining business on the moon. Through buying, placing, and maintaining various facilities on the lunar surface, you can use your management skills to sustain a colony, expa